    "\n",
    "1. What is the difference between a decorator and a context manager?\n",
    "2. How do generators achieve memory efficiency? Give an ML example.\n",
    "3. What is MRO (Method Resolution Order) in Python and why does it matter for mixins?\n",
    "4. When would you use a singleton pattern? What are alternatives?\n",
    "5. How does the observer pattern help in ML monitoring?\n",
    "6. What is dependency injection and why is it useful for ML pipelines?\n",
    "7. Explain the descriptor protocol with a practical ML example.\n",
    "8. When would you use a metaclass vs a class decorator?\n",
    "9. How would you implement a retry decorator for an ML API endpoint?\n",
    "10. What are the SOLID principles and how do they apply to Python ML code?"
   ]
